  "id": "apricot-chicken-curry",
  "name": "Apricot Chicken Curry",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken in a spiced apricot sauce",
  "description": "Chicken drumsticks are browned, roasted, then finished with apricots, vegetables, and curry powder in a lightly thickened fruit sauce.",
